<title>HONG KONG: Korean French Banking sets $60 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Korean French Banking sets $60 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced on Tuesday by arranger Fuji International Finance (HK).</p>
<p> BORROWER   KOREAN FRENCH BANKING CORP</p>
<p> AMOUNT     US$60 MLN  COUPON     3ML+50BP   MATURITY  5 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRCD	 ISS PRICE  PAR	  LAUNCHED  18.NOV.96</p>
<p> PUTS	 YR 3	 CALLS	YR 3	 REPLIES   04.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE	 REPAYMENT  BULLET     DENOMS    $500K</p>
<p> RATING     NONE	 SALE LMTS  STANDARD   TAX PROV  --</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	  CRS DEF    YES	  FORCE MAJ IPMA2</p>
<p> HOME CTRY  S.KOREA    GOV LAW    ENGLISH</p>
<p> PAY DATE   30.DEC.96 (EXPECTED)</p>
<p> MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>   CO-LEAD MANAGERS    US$5 MLN+    36BP   ALL-IN  62</p>
<p>   MANAGERS		US$2-4 MLN   30BP   ALL-IN  60</p>
<p> ARRANGERS  BANK AUSTRIA, BFCE SINGAPORE, FUJI INTERNATIONAL</p>
<p>		FINANCE HK (BOOKS), BANK BERLINER GROUP (BOOKS),</p>
<p>		AND KDB INTERNATIONAL SINGAPORE</p>
<p> NOTES	SHAREHOLDER CONVENANT: SOCIETE GENERALE MUST</p>
<p>		MAINTAIN AT LEAST 30 PCT OF THE ISSUER</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
